        <h1>华硕破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16G + 512G”版本，3999 元</h1>

        <div class="info clearfix">
            <div class="l">

                    <span id="pubtime_baidu">2026/8/25 9:37:55</span>
                    <span id="source_baidu">来源：<a href="https://www.ithome.com/0/993/823.htm" target="_blank">IT之家</a></span>
                    <span id="author_baidu">作者：<strong>漾仔</strong></span>

                    <span id="editor_baidu">责编：<strong>漾仔</strong></span>
            </div>

            <div class="r">

                <span id="hitcount"></span>
                    <a href="#post_comm" class="pti_comm">评论：<span id="commentcount"></span></a>
            </div>
        </div>



        <div class="post_content " id="paragraph">
            <div class='tougao-user' >感谢IT之家网友 <a href='https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2029428' rel='nofollow'>华南吴彦祖</a> 的线索投递！</div>
            <p data-vmark="26b2"><a class="s_tag" href="https://www.ithome.com/" target="_blank">IT之家</a> 8 月 25 日消息，华硕现已为旗下破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16GB RAM + 512GB SSD”版本，<strong>定价为 3999 元</strong>，部分地区国补后 3229 元。</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/kDWrbqv" target="_blank" data-wapurl="https://u.jd.com/kDWKpmJ" data-iosurl="https://u.jd.com/kGWGOkO" data-androidurl="https://u.jd.com/kOWKWHM" data-hosnexturl="https://u.jd.com/k6WgdvK" data-hosurl="https://u.jd.com/krWCDHG" data-uwpurl="https://u.jd.com/kGWihRi" data-wxmpurl="ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fk6Ws9Iq%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380" data-itwxurl="https://u.jd.com/kgWO0Gm" data-lpwxurl="https://u.jd.com/k1W1Ii3" data-ncid="223947"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img src="//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png" w="1500" h="1500" class="lazy" title="华硕破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16G + 512G”版本，3999 元" data-original="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/392698/26/4582/62603/69797a50F97ca7fd9/00835dc5dc88af33.png" width="1500" height="820"></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">华硕破晓迷你主机</span></span><span class="card-abstract"> i5-13500H + 16GB RAM + 512GB SSD</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">3999 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p data-vmark="25b8" style="text-align: center;"><img src="//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png" w="758" h="974" data-mpos="2,0" data-vmark="62b5" class="lazy" title="华硕破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16G + 512G”版本，3999 元" data-original="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/d06fa208-44f9-40f0-a5a5-e8a3da3fbbff.jpg" width="758" height="974"></p><p data-vmark="ba79" style="text-align: center;"><img src="//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png" w="728" h="1422" data-mpos="2,0" data-vmark="0127" class="lazy" title="华硕破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16G + 512G”版本，3999 元" data-original="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/85b07902-7ff5-494a-8cbb-5c7f5f33ee3b.jpg" width="728" height="1422"></p><p data-vmark="9d55">该机整体造型低调，使用哑光纹理设计，整体尺寸为 128.4 x 128.4 x 40.5mm，搭载 12 核心 16 线程英特尔酷睿 i5-13500H 处理器，匹配 16GB DDR4 3200MHz RAM 和 512GB SSD。</p><p data-vmark="8d38" style="text-align: center;"><img src="//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png" w="892" h="562" data-mpos="2,0" data-vmark="414d" class="lazy" title="华硕破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16G + 512G”版本，3999 元" srcset="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/ac62a86c-e084-451e-adb0-6306c4fca31e.jpg 2x" data-original="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/ac62a86c-e084-451e-adb0-6306c4fca31e.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_517" width="892" height="517"></p><p data-vmark="c1f9">该机支持蓝牙 5.2 和 Wi-Fi 6，机身正面提供 2 个 USB-A 3.2 Gen 2 接口、1 个 USB-C 3.2 Gen 1 接口、1 个 3.5mm 音频接口；后侧提供 2 个 USB-A 3.2 Gen 1 接口、2 个 HDMI 接口、2 个 RJ 45 网口、1 个 DP 1.2 接口。</p><p data-vmark="72eb">IT之家附产品参数：</p><p data-vmark="b16a" style="text-align: center;"><img src="//img.ithome.com/images/v2/t.png" w="906" h="1028" data-mpos="0,0" data-vmark="e236" class="lazy" title="华硕破晓迷你主机新增“i5-13500H + 16G + 512G”版本，3999 元" srcset="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/5efbbbc5-6fec-44d5-b7e7-08a5186d0688.jpg 2x" data-original="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/5efbbbc5-6fec-44d5-b7e7-08a5186d0688.jpg@s_2,w_820,h_930" width="906" height="930"></p><p class="ad-tips">广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家包含外链的文章均包含本声明。</p>
        </div>

        
        

        


